\f1\fs22 After Sarah told her to be with Hayley and left, and Chip wished her a morning and left, and Alexander told her to go find Hayley and left, Kathy sat numb. Minutes passed until she found the impulse to reanimate herself.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

